Hello time-travelers, we have some news! 

A new, tiny update for our Time Loader demo is now available! The update, which you can already download, introduces a number of changes including: 


Our favorite robot just got a screen that will show its emotions. Don't forget to say hello!
Improved physics to really show your amazing parkour skills;
More in-game props and 90s-inspired decorations;
A number of performance improvements and bug fixes;


The patch should start downloading automatically the next time you launch the Time Loader demo. If that doesn't happen, please try restarting your Steam client or checking the game cache's integrity.
